Here is the continuation and completion of the IntarsiaML architecture plan (v0.2), picking up from the `mermaid` diagram in Section 2 and proceeding through the remaining architectural sections.

---

```mermaid
  end
  subgraph Core["Engine core (crate: intarsia-core)"]
    SCHED["Scheduler: Pre-fill/Decode batching, KV cache management"]
    MODEL["Model Router: Dispatches to block library based on config"]
    KV["KV Cache: Paged, unified memory layout (CUDA/HIP)"]
    METRICS["Metrics: Latency, throughput, memory usage, token counts"]
  end
  subgraph Kernels["Kernel Packs (Crate: intarsia-kernels)"]
    TF["TensorFold (MIT): GEMM, MoE, Quantization packs"]
    RAD["Radiance (Apache-2.0): Attention, Norm, Rope, Sampling packs"]
    PORT["ik_portable.h: Shared intrinsics for elementwise ops"]
  end
  subgraph Tools["Offline Tools (Python/uv)"]
    GOLD["Golden Ref: HF Transformers logits"]
    CONV["Converters: Safet
